    {
      "id": "945bc5cc5c2f53912599dc9f29e75056a94495a2",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1236734262,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Just out of curiosity, what OS/CPU combinations were producing extra leading or trailing whitespace?",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-01-12T08:22:39.567Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-01-12T08:22:39.567Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 198772772,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 9392,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ff422ea15c83c23c11f58eb35640ea3500a7b301",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1237193557,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Windows/AMD x64. Doesn't happen on Linux. I did not test with other CPUs.\n\n```\nCompiled (64-bit) using Microsoft Visual Studio 2022 (VC++ 14.34, build 31937),\nwith GLib 2.72.3, with PCRE2, with zlib 1.2.12, with libpcap, with Lua 5.2.4,\nwith GnuTLS 3.6.3 and PKCS #11 support, with Gcrypt 1.10.1, with Kerberos (MIT),\nwith MaxMind, with nghttp2 1.49.0, with brotli, with LZ4, with Zstandard, with\nSnappy, with libxml2 2.9.14, with libsmi 0.4.8, with binary plugins, debug build\n(+assert +utf8).\n\nRunning on 64-bit Windows (22H2), build 22621, with AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core\nProcessor              (with SSE4.2), with 32690 MB of physical memory, with\nGLib 2.72.3, with PCRE2 10.40 2022-04-14, without Npcap or WinPcap, with c-ares\n1.18.1, with GnuTLS 3.6.3, with Gcrypt 1.10.1, with nghttp2 1.49.0, with brotli\n1.0.9, with LZ4 1.9.3, with Zstandard 1.5.2, with LC_TYPE=English_United\nStates.utf8, binary plugins supported.\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 2639362,
            "username": "jvalverde",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "João Valverde",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bea5f745397cf5a2fe0526df96ec143db47f9334340ab56515038832be57e976?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/jvalverde"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-01-12T13:05:09.974Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-01-12T13:05:09.974Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 198772772,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 9392,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ad551013409983ccf835064ecb60f4f50549b2d9",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1238381866,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Given that Intel gives an example of the CPUID instructions to fetch the brand string providing a string, on a Pentium 4, with leading blanks, and given that it's possible that Windows don't trim off leading or trailing blanks when stuffing brand strings into the Registry, it's possible that we will have to do so ourselves.  Linux might trim the blanks.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-01-13T08:57:20.079Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-01-13T08:57:20.079Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 198772772,
